{"id":"n26653-1-8","stage":4,"title":"개신교 · 新教","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26653-1-8-1","ko":"너도 네 동생처럼 성당에 다니니?","zh":"你也像你弟弟一样去天主教堂吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동생처럼","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성당에","meaning":"教堂，天主堂","explanation":"성당：教堂，天主堂；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"성당","audio":"/audio/d3997782e4484b895c96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49062","senseId":"1","lemma":"성당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니니?","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"d3997782e4484b89","term":"성당","zh":"教堂，天主堂","audio":"/audio/d3997782e4484b895c96.mp3","entryId":"49062","definition":"进行天主教宗教仪式的建筑。","pronunciation":["성ː당"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/922a19a7b4602c46e686.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26653-1-8-2","ko":"아니, 난 개신교라 교회에 다녀.","zh":"不，我是新教徒，所以去教会。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개신교라","meaning":"新教","explanation":"개신교：新教；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"개신교","audio":"/audio/24955b002b54344e878a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26653","senseId":"1","lemma":"개신교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교회에","meaning":"教会","explanation":"교회：教会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"교회","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64370","senseId":"1","lemma":"교회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀.","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"24955b002b54344e","term":"개신교","zh":"新教","audio":"/audio/24955b002b54344e878a.mp3","entryId":"26653","definition":"因宗教改革而从天主教分离出来的基督教的一个教派。","pronunciation":["개ː신교"]},{"id":"24c3101dae86eeec","term":"교회","zh":"教会","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3","entryId":"64370","definition":"把耶稣基督视为救世主而信仰并追随的人们的共同体；或指那种人聚集在一起举行宗教活动的场所。","pronunciation":["교ː회","교ː훼"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7202613908016f1c758e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.518,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26653","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不，我是新教徒，所以去教会。","你也像你弟弟一样去天主教堂吗？","听说你之前生病了，现在好点了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你也像你弟弟一样去天主教堂吗？","听说你之前生病了，现在好点了吗？","不，我是新教徒，所以去教会。"],"answer":2}]}
